    THE COMPLETE PATTERN DISPLAYED.    ÃHOOSING 2, 3, OR MORE CYCLES WILL    GENERATE THAT MANY CHUNKS OF THE    SAME PATTERN, CONSECUTIVLY IN    MEMORY AND FITTED WITHIN YOUR    HI/LO RANGE AND NUMBER OF DATA.    ÏNE CYCLE SHOULD BE USED UNLESS    YOU WANT A DENSER REPEATING SET OF    DATA.  ÁFTER ALL THAT IS ENTERED, THE DATA  WILL BE GENERATED, AND YOU'LL BE  ASKED FOR A FILENAME TO SAVE THE   DATA. ÈIT RETURN WITHOUT ENTERING ANY  FILENAME TO ABORT AND RESTART ×IX.  ÏTHERWISE THE DATA IS SAVED AS SUCH:  1 BYTE DATA:        FROM $3800 - $3800+# DATA  2 BYTE DATA LO BYTES:        FROM $3800 - $3800+# DATA              HI BYTES:     FROM $3800+# DATA - $3800+2*# DATA2) ÍIXED PATTERN: ÔHIS WILL USE THE  CURRENT PATTERN AND ONE OTHER  SELECTED PATTERN, AND AVERAGE THE  TWO PATTERNS TOGETHER TO FORM A  THIRD PATTERN. ÙOU'LL BE ASKED THE  SAME SERIES OF QUESTIONS AS ABOVE.3) ÉNDEXED ÐATTERN: ÔHE INDEXED PATTERN  GENERATOR WILL USE THE CURRENT  PATTERN AS A BASE AND ANOTHER   SELECTED PATTERN AS THE INDEX. ÔHE  INDEX PATTERN IS USED TO SELECT DATA  VALUES OUT OF THE BASE DATA VALUES.  ÔHEN THOSE VALUES ARE STORED AS THE  ACTUAL PATTERN. ÔHIS SHOULD YEILD  SOME VERY STRANGE RESULTS AND ODD  PATTERNS, BUT YOU'LL NEED TO  EXPERIMENT TO FIND WHAT YOU WANT...ÃLOSING REMARKS---------------  É SHOULD SAY THANKS TO ÆIREFOOT -WITHOUT HIS WHINING AND COMPLAININGABOUT THIS UTIL, IT SHOULDN'T BENEARLY AS GOOD AS IT IS NOW :)  ÉT'S RATHER NICE TO RECOGNIZE THESEPATTERNS IN OTHER PEOPLE'S DEMOS... ÉGET A GOOD FEELING KNOWING THERE'S ABIT OF ×IX (& ME) IN MORE THAN A FEWDEMOS RELEASED THESE DAYS... ÂUT ÉALSO DO IT FOR ÙÏÕ, SO IF ÙÏÕ FIND ANYBUGS, HAVE ANY COMMENTS OR SUGGESTIONS,OR FOR WHATEVER OTHER REASON WOULD LIKETO CONTACT ME, THEN ÐÌÅÁÓÅ WRITE: ÅLWIX/ÓTYLE Ò.È.É.Ô. ÂOX 578 6060 ×ABASH ÁVE ÔERRE ÈAUTE ÉÎ 47803-3999 Õ.Ó.Á.ÏR ÐÌÅÁÓÅ CALL: (812)877-8534.